    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Giant Rats.</strong> This warrior of Skaven enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“The clever rat does not stand where the blade is falling.”<br><em>— Thanquol</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Boulder Throw, Rusty Blade, Jagged Spear, Sling, Massive Projectile / Boulder Throw, Scurry Away!, Strength in Numbers, Massive Boulder Throw, Warplock Pistol. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
